        "name": "Escaping",
        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The term is percent-encoded with `urllib.parse.quote_plus` inside the href, and the href and visible text are both HTML-escaped with `html.escape(quote=True)`, so inputs like `\"><script>x</script>` or `a&b=c` cannot break out of either context; tests cover both cases."
      },
      {
        "name": "Behavior",
